flowchart TD
    A["PS7331 official source / image / package"] --> B["Registration or shipped config"]
    B --> C["Binder Stub, init, file_context, CIL, manifest"]
    C --> D{ "Caller / permission / SELinux gate" }
    D -->|"ordinary app or shell"| X["No accepted high-impact path observed"]
    D -->|"trusted system, owner, profile or OTA lifecycle"| E["Identity and user propagation"]
    E --> F["Sensitive sink"]
    F --> F1["PackageManager / HOME / package state"]
    F --> F2["Settings / DPM / profile state"]
    F --> F3["OTA / recovery / partition capability"]
    F --> F4["driver / procfs / native client"]

    G["Existing runtime evidence"] --> H["Read-only state or prior reversible result"]
    H -. "not a new writer" .-> D
    I["Accessibility / foreground fallback"] --> J["Delayed explicit launch"]
    J -. "not formal HOME or privilege transition" .-> X
    K["Unknown caller, client, holder, or consumer"] -. "evidence gap" .-> X
    L["Risk-rejected: unknown Binder, ioctl, OTA replay, Root, partition write"] -. "not executed" .-> F
